.TH AERO-SCREEN-RECORDER 1 "November 2026" "Aero Linux v1.4.0" "Aero Linux Manual"
.SH NAME
aero-screen-recorder \- Hardware-accelerated desktop screen recording utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero-screen-recorder
[B\-\-outputR IFileR] [B\-\-framerateR IFPSR] [B\-\-hardwareR IEncoderR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero-screen-recorder
captures Wayland and X11 desktop display streams utilizing VA-API and NVENC hardware video encoding pipelines.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " IFileR
Destination video file path (default: ~/Videos/recordings/capture.mp4).
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-framerate " " IFPSR
Capture frame rate (default: 60).
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display brief usage synopsis.
